    "author": null,
    "content": "<p>War Robots: Frontiers players on Steam can now take their battles on the go with the portable Steam Deck! The game has achieved &ldquo;Playable&rdquo; status, meaning Steam players can pilot their War Robots anywhere. Simply find the game in your Steam Library to start playing.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>While it&rsquo;s not yet fully &ldquo;Verified&rdquo;, you might encounter minor UI issues, such as:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>Entering text may require manually invoking the on-screen keyboard</li>\r\n\t<li>Some in-game text is small and may be difficult to read</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>For more about the Steam Deck, <a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/steamdeck\">visit their official website</a>, or get help at <a href=\"https://help.steampowered.com/\">Steam Support</a>. Get ready to take your War Robots: Frontiers battles anywhere&mdash;the Wild Ten is waiting for you!</p>",
